{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/3371815ca793b8a7f4ff26a2bc4d2325.avif?t=1770377361\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras_big/3371815ca793b8a7f4ff26a2bc4d2325.avif?t=1770377361 width=800 height=282 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300aMoor Rail\u300b is a strategic lateral scroll shooting action game set in diesel funk.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/e1311a76c2a0459ed80c8b888c80d47a.poster.avif?t=1770377361\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/e1311a76c2a0459ed80c8b888c80d47a.webm?t=1770377361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/e1311a76c2a0459ed80c8b888c80d47a.mp4?t=1770377361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you strengthen your train, you can increase your load, speed up, and install vehicles that assist or attack your battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hire several mercenaries who fight together on the train and help combat situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Marigold of a delivery driver from a carrier who receives a commission and carries the goods will receive a suspicious commission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a simple request to purchase a &quot;Core&quot; item from a far away village and transport it to the destination, but, unsuspectingly, the compensation for the request was a large amount of compensation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was suspicious, but Marigold started delivering because it was a request.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will we be able to deliver it safely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>\u25c6 Reach your destination by stopping enemies from attacking on a running train.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/cdf447a1ae67167f8e6b7d4f0a837fdc.poster.avif?t=1770377361\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/cdf447a1ae67167f8e6b7d4f0a837fdc.webm?t=1770377361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/cdf447a1ae67167f8e6b7d4f0a837fdc.mp4?t=1770377361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can stop enemies by using specialized skills and weapons that vary from character to character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your skills and items to help you win by applying them to your player's advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Beware of mutated bosses or looters who are powerful and do not die easily.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/afc1d7a7a3739d9a2baabed7b8b3b374.poster.avif?t=1770377361\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/afc1d7a7a3739d9a2baabed7b8b3b374.webm?t=1770377361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/afc1d7a7a3739d9a2baabed7b8b3b374.mp4?t=1770377361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of boss will appear? What pattern will the boss use?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a boss match, you have to figure out the pattern and play it to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How big a treatment reward would I get if I killed my boss?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Make maintenance at the station to reach your destination.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/de02aeb2ce7d2a064bfcc2b613651ac0.poster.avif?t=1770377361\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/de02aeb2ce7d2a064bfcc2b613651ac0.webm?t=1770377361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/de02aeb2ce7d2a064bfcc2b613651ac0.mp4?t=1770377361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can deploy trains according to their roles, so you can use a variety of strategies, and the upgrade will allow you to run better-performing trains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, you can upgrade the passive and player that are applied to your advantage in the game to facilitate play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 To move on to the next chapter, succeed in the quest.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/c2c8f5e3e4e2a9f72d7f6e042b33e84f.poster.avif?t=1770377361\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/c2c8f5e3e4e2a9f72d7f6e042b33e84f.webm?t=1770377361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/c2c8f5e3e4e2a9f72d7f6e042b33e84f.mp4?t=1770377361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and proceed with the quest that the player wants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you give up or fail the quest, you will be fined a hefty fine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail and pay the fine, succeed and earn the reward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/2964be536f9e758224bbca888c8e6886.poster.avif?t=1770377361\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/2964be536f9e758224bbca888c8e6886.webm?t=1770377361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/2964be536f9e758224bbca888c8e6886.mp4?t=1770377361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Connection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3009410/99028b0bccf9ae2af77d2fbe35268aa13d0c36b2.jpg"},{"name":"Early End!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3009410/4afe23cb8f0154bdc13e3682c432e49cacfd0ca6.jpg"},{"name":"Backing up...?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3009410/5efab39c5131a74ac3a0dced1c2412e838e0ae4a.jpg"},{"name":"Annoying, right?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3009410/e77f4436fb2053fb0dfd825d73020e243bdd7980.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 1-1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3009410/bf72a923faeb8ad85abb2826b003575e61fdb061.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 1-2","path":"https://cdn.akama